<title>HONG KONG: Merrill sets Henderson Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets Henderson Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co, C.V. said on Friday it has launched 80 million American-style call warrants on shares of Henderson Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>STRIKE PRICE	HK$76.85	  PREMIUM	     13.9 PCT</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.00	   GEARING	     7.63X</p>
<p>EXPIRATION	  21.NOV.97	 BOARD LOT	   10,000</p>
<p>LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE    HK$76.25</p>
<p>NOTES: PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY. GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
